> Your "ranking" is determined solely by your experience level. The
> minimum level required for the quest is always 14.

And while XP level has a big effect on your success rate, casting
spells has no direct effect at all on XP level.  You can go around
the entire game casting force bolt on every door and I don't think it
will help.  Certainly no amount of casting identify will help at all.
The main way early on to advance in XP levels is to get the
experience from killing monsters.  Attack spells are only one way
to kill monsters.  Tater there are several other ways to gain levels
that can be used to get the extra boost needed to qualify for the
Quest.



